			"In a fight, the game's crossed swords now sit just above the top right corner of the player portrait, no longer on the picture, and its sleeping letters do the same while resting. In \001One frame\002 they sit above the whole frame. The new \001Combat and resting icons\002 row on the \001Player frame\002 tab can put them back where the game draws them. A change made in a fight applies as it ends.",
